Value FAN_ID (\d+|\S+)
Value MODEL (.*)
Value STATUS (ok|fail|absent|\S+)
Value HARDWARE_VERSION (\S+)
Value SERIAL_NUMBER (\S+)

Start
  ^Fan id\s+Type\s+Status
  ^-+
  ^${FAN_ID}\s+${MODEL}\s{2,}${STATUS}\s{2,}${HARDWARE_VERSION}\s{2,}${SERIAL_NUMBER}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^${FAN_ID}\s+${MODEL}\s+${STATUS}\s+${HARDWARE_VERSION}\s+${SERIAL_NUMBER}\s*$$ -> Record
